# Optional built-in Anthropic API key (feature 005-build-time-api-key).
#
# Copy this file to .env (git-ignored) and set a real key to produce a build
# where AI features work with zero key setup. Leave unset (or blank) for the
# standard BYOK-only build — users then paste their own key in Settings.
# A key saved in Settings always overrides the built-in key.
#
# ⚠️  SECURITY: any value here is baked into the public JS bundle and is
# extractable by anyone who can load the build. Personal / privately shared
# deployments ONLY. NEVER set this variable in the Vercel project (or any CI)
# for the public deployment. Prefer a dedicated key with a spend limit so it
# can be revoked without collateral damage.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_KEY=sk-ant-your-key
